     2	
     3	## BLOCKER
     4	
     5	无。
     6	
     7	## HIGH
     8	
     9	1. **H1 REGRESSED：容器前缀仍被破坏，`~~~lang\`` 也没有按声明报出 A 孤儿。**
    10	
    11	   位置：[vault_lint.py:351](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:351)、[vault_lint.py:390](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:390)、[test_vault_lint.py:1284](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/tests/unit/test_vault_lint.py:1284)。
    12	
    13	   反例：
    14	
    15	   ```md
    16	   <!-- AUTO-GENERATED by .claude/scripts/sync_board_concepts.py source -->
    17	   - ~~~text
    18	     <!-- /AUTO-GENERATED -->
    19	     [[A]]
    20	     ~~~
    21	   ```
    22	
    23	   原文 mdit 为 list 内 `fence [1,5]`；但 `- ` 不是前导空白，当前实现把整行改成列 0 `<!--x-->`，且不记 anomaly。真实 CLI：
    24	
    25	   ```text
    26	   rc=0, status=ok, orphans=[], inbound_targets=1, blind_spots=0
    27	   ```
    28	
    29	   `~~~lang\`` 同样得到：
    30	
    31	   ```text
    32	   rc=2, status=warn, orphans=[], inbound_targets=1
    33	   ```
    34	
    35	   因而“随段盲化、A 报孤儿”不成立。新增门的名称/docstring 写 A 应报孤儿，但 [test_vault_lint.py:1300-1305](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/tests/unit/test_vault_lint.py:1300) 实际断言 `subjects == []`，锁定了相反极性。
    36	
