    38	
    39	   位置：[vault_lint.py:346-348](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:346)、[vault_lint.py:383-389](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:383)。
    40	
    41	   `(?=$|\s|-->|-)` 允许任意连字符后缀：
    42	
    43	   ```md
    44	   <!-- AUTO-GENERATED by .claude/scripts/sync_board_concepts.py source -->
    45	   <!-- /AUTO-GENERATED-NESS -->
