docs/superpowers/plans/2026-04-07-fr-kg-04-a7-deep-research-manifest.md:170:**Stated rationale** (`design.md` L57-69): SyncService has enforced non-null `group_id` on all writes since commit `1ea43b2`, so the only NULL-`group_id` nodes that exist are historical demo seeds. The `OR IS NULL` clause keeps those readable to all groups during the demo phase. The reasoning continues: "IS NULL doesn't leak Subject A's data to Subject B — it only allows 'orphan' nodes to be visible to any group."
